{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Reserve time for failure-evidence publication**\n\nThe bounded build, deployment, assertion, and collection steps already total 80 minutes. Setup, credential actions, artifact upload, and summary must fit in the remaining five minutes, so a near-budget assertion run can trigger the job timeout before the `always()` collection and upload steps finish. Increase the job timeout or reduce the child budgets to preserve diagnostics.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7079e8","finding_digest":"26eb281c458002fba20008b30164368bde193109965b85c484fc5df3c69c96a8","finding_id":"arf_v1_e3vsqhcfqabpxiqabczqczbwrp","finding_key":"github/workflows/lmi-e2e-tests.yml::cloud-job::evidence-collection-timeout-headroom","identity_key":"github/workflows/lmi-e2e-tests.yml::cloud-job::evidence-collection-timeout-headroom","line":37,"observation_digest":"325c0fad6a2d16cfd4b978688a505740cd7ed7ed7ddaa239e25f28042f984c33","observation_id":"aro_v1_gjoa7llkfulm7vfzpbuiuucxid","path":".github/workflows/lmi-e2e-tests.yml","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-25T23:29:40Z","review_id":"arr_v1_bcb2riqqmpvss4ajdasujerbha","reviewed_base_sha":"26aea6172a6820bec1be1427c4d8c4207a1dab28","reviewed_head_sha":"e5bb3f8c5f3bae7162c08f1d518c6c1561a29125","reviewer":"codex","start_line":37,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_wv3eaio3rvhwwtaty5lsefm4s3"},"pull_request":{"number":728},"record_id":"art_v1_f73xcghgbmcyze3utqizgw3rt5","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-25T23:29:40Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
